                                       Patrick.Schaefer@prc.nm.gov




                                       ___________________________
                                       Keven Gedko
                                       Hearing Examiner
                                       Keven.Gedko@prc.nm.gov




2
 For reference, see testimony by SPS Witness Taylor J. Hurt, Transcript Volume II at 372:7-13, and testimony by
Alexander Trwobridge, Transcript Vol. II at 463:2-3, 464:22-25, stating: “[T]he Residential class represents about 5%
of total kWh sales from a forecast perspective,” and “PTCs are going to get allocated according to the kWh that are
used by the 4 voltage classes.”


